    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Enkikilikuanata naipirta eneing'uaa engolon e Yesu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore nabo olong, eiteng'enita ltung'ana nelikioo lomon supati te nkaji e Nkai, nepuonu lapolosak kituaak o lasirak o lpayiani enetii ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nejoki ninye, “Toliki iyiook ae te ngolon e ng'ae ias iyie kuna baa, ae ng'ae likincho ena golon?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Newaliki ninye ajoki, “Kaikilikuan sii nanu intae embae nabo; entolikioki, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "amaa apa enkibatisa e Yohana ai shumata eing'uaa, anaa ltung'ana?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neiguana maate ejo, “Amaa tenikijo, ‘Shumata eing'uaa’, nejoki iyiook, ‘Oo naa pee eitu irukuruku?' ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake ti nikijo, Iltung'ana eing'uaa,’ nenang iyiook kulo tung'ana pooki too soito; amu eyiolo too ltauja aajo oloiboni le Nkai Yohana.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Newaliki aajoki, mikiyiolo eneing'uaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejoki Yesu ninche, “Maliki sii nanu intae eneing'uaa engolon naasie kuna baa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Enkitanyaanyukoto oo sinkan ooisilenokoki enkurma oo lng'anayio",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.5.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isa 5.1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Neiter aliki olorere ena kitanyaanyukoto, “Etuno oltung'ani enkurma oo lng'anayio, neisho laramatak meisilenoi nelo ai kop nebik enkata naado. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore pee ebau enkata, neirriu osinka airriwaki ilaramatak, meishoo ematua oo lng'anayio le ina kurma; kake eidong'o lelo ooisilenoitie ninye nerriny too nkaik naarook. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neirriwaa likae sinka; near sii ilo nesul, nearaa too nkaik naarook. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitoki ake airriwaa oli okuni, nepik ilbaa ilo nearaa ong'ata. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejo olopeny enkurma ina oolng'anayio, ‘Kaji aiko? Olayioni lai kirotet airriwaa; kebaiki neyanyit ninye.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake ore pee edol lelo ooisilenoitie ninye, nejokino maate, ‘Ele doi olajung'oni, mataar pee eaku enaang enjung'ore.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nearaa auluo enkurma near metua. Kaa pasa kenya eitaasi ninche olopeny enkurma? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kelotu aidaikie lelo ooisilenoitie neisho kulikae ina kurma.” Ore pee ening ninche ina nejo, “Taba meiwuang'a!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.118.22"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Olke 118.22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kake eing'ura Yesu ninche nejo, “Kaa naa ena nasira, ‘Ilo soit otanyaita lashetak otaa ole lukunya o lmairroto?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore pooki ng'ae osulakino ilo soit negiligil aitaa mpurdat; kake ore ake olourokino ninye nerrar tukul.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Enkikilikuanata naipirta elaata e kodi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neiteru lasirak o lapolosak kituaak aajo matipik inkaik te ina saa, kake etureita olorere; amu etoduaa aajo ninche eipirie ina kitanyaanyukoto.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Metaa neing'or ninche ninye neirriwaki ilaikeernok ooitaakuno supati te Nkai, pee etum aawaita kuna naajo, netum aaitarasaki enkitoria o enkiguana o lbalusui. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neikilikuan ninche aajoki, “Olaiteng'enani, kiyiolo aajo iro iyie ninteng'enisho too sipat, metii enyorrakino, kake iutu iyie enkoitoi e Nkai te sipata. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Keishiaakino neishori Kaisari kodi ana aimeishiaakino?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake etayiolo ninye enkeleekisho enye, nejoki, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Entoduaaki empisai. Ai ng'ae esirakino naa kole ng'ae olkigeroto oata?” Nejoki, “Ole Kaisari.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejoki ninche, “Enchoo naa Kaisari inaara ine Kaisari, ninchosho Enkai inaara ine Nkai.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nelaikino aaibung'a ninye etii olorere te nena naatejo; kake eing'asiate ninche te nena naawalu negira.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Enkikilikuanata naipirta empiunoto oo lootuata",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
